# What the hosted deployment does NOT need.
#
# Kept explicit rather than inherited, because the hosted public demo READS
# fixtures/recorder/*.json at runtime: the recorded investigations are replayed
# from those scenario files through the production Flight Recorder. Excluding
# them leaves the demo with three cards and nothing behind them, so this list
# must never grow a `fixtures/` line.
#
# .npmignore and Dockerfile carry the same requirement for the packaged and
# containerised builds; tests/packaging.test.mjs holds all of them to it.

.github/
build/
docs/
tests/
coverage/
data/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
ROADMAP.md
.vercel/
